TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution in acidic Cu-Ba solution at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -totals C(4) Cu(2)
END
